        <!-- ===== Legend ===== -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="WireGuard hub-and-spoke overlay — 10.88.0.0/24, UDP 51820. Each school server is a peer; the hub has the only public endpoint.&#10;Central → schools (over VPN): content-sync push, config, monitoring, admin/SSH.   Schools → central: sync-queue uploads + health heartbeats.&#10;Each school server runs offline LMS and serves local users over its LAN/Wi-Fi; the public Internet is needed only to carry the encrypted tunnel.&#10;— — green dashed = encrypted WireGuard tunnel." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
